{% extends "base.html" %}
{% load static %}	
{% load blog_tags %}


{% block title %}Privacy Policy{% endblock %}


{% block extra_css %}
<style>
    .privacy-policy {
        padding: 2rem;
        background-color: #f9f9f9;
        margin-top: 130px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        margin-bottom: 30px;
        width: 90%;
    }

    .privacy-title {
        color: #007bff;
        font-weight: 700;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .privacy-text {
        line-height: 1.6;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        color: #232323;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
        .privacy-policy {
            padding: 1rem;
        }
    }
</style>
{% endblock %}


{% block content %}


<h1 class="privacy-title">Terms and Conditions for SMS Communications</h1><br>

<h2 class="privacy-title">1 - SMS Consent and Privacy</h2>
<p class="privacy-text">
    Phone numbers collected as part of the SMS consent process will not be shared with third parties for marketing purposes.
</p>

<h2 class="privacy-title">2 - Types of SMS Messages</h2>
<p class="privacy-text">
    If you consent to receive SMS messages from Auto Haul Movers LLC, you may receive messages such as:<br>
    - Order updates: notifications about shipments, deliveries, or account status.<br>
    - Service alerts: updates regarding maintenance, service availability, or compliance notifications.
</p>

<h2 class="privacy-title">3 - Message Frequency</h2>
<p class="privacy-text">
    The number of messages may vary based on communication type. You may receive up to 3 SMS messages per week related to order updates or service alerts.
</p>

<h2 class="privacy-title">4 - Potential Carrier Charges</h2>
<p class="privacy-text">
    Standard message and data rates may apply depending on your carrier and your plan, including international messaging fees if applicable.
</p>

<h2 class="privacy-title">5 - How to Opt-In</h2>
<p class="privacy-text">
    You can consent to receive SMS messages from Auto Haul Movers LLC by:<br>
    - Submitting an online form on our website.<br>
    - Providing verbal consent during service registration.
</p>

<h2 class="privacy-title">6 - How to Opt-Out</h2>
<p class="privacy-text">
    You may opt out at any time by replying “STOP” to any SMS you receive from us. Alternatively, you can contact us directly at info@autohaulmovers.com or phone +1 (843) 376-1348 to request removal from our messaging list.
</p>

<h2 class="privacy-title">7 - Need Help?</h2>
<p class="privacy-text">
    If you need assistance, reply “HELP” to any SMS message or contact us directly using the contact information above.
</p>

<h2 class="privacy-title">8 - Additional Options</h2>
<p class="privacy-text">
    If you prefer not to receive SMS messages, simply do not check the SMS consent box on our forms.
</p>

<h2 class="privacy-title">9 - Standard Messaging Disclosures</h2>
<p class="privacy-text">
    Message and data rates may apply.<br>
    You may opt out at any time by texting “STOP.”<br>
    For help, text “HELP” or visit our Privacy Policy and Terms and Conditions pages.<br>
    Message frequency may vary.
</p>


{% endblock %}
